                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">We include in this definition a toggle to switch between the shop mode (Add to Cart button in the App) and a backoffice mode that can be used to export files related to each order.

After an order is placed in Shopify, the model state corresponding to the order can be loaded in the App by the store owner, and the backoffice mode can be enabled to enable the export functionality.</item>
